// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
// Sonore SDK test harness. Two halves, both mattering:
//
//  1) the DSP toolkit measured, not eyeballed: a filter that says it cuts must
//     measurably cut, polyBLEP must beat naive aliasing, the compressor's
//     measured ratio must match its declared one;
//  2) the CLAP wrapper driven exactly as a host drives it: create through the
//     factory, activate, push param + note events, process, save/load state.
//     Every bug this catches is one a DAW would otherwise find first.
//
// Deliberately dependency-free (no gtest): one binary, exit code is the verdict.
